{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>this is the first episode, more to come soon.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/TwilightTalesSplash4591x1561.png?t=1744566349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Twilight Tales</strong> is a series of short games based on psychological horror and the choices you make, which will determine whether you survive or not. You choose your own ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/hollow_sStore.png?t=1744566349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this first episode of <strong>Twilight Tales</strong>, you'll take care of the tasks in a small store deep in the woods, all while avoiding the dangers that come with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/Twilight_Tales_GIF.gif?t=1744566349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/gameplay.png?t=1744566349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hollow's Store</strong> offers an immersive first-person experience thanks to mechanics like cleaning, restocking, checking out, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/extras/features.png?t=1744566349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game features numerous traits, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic aesthetics and everyday atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cleaning, checking out, and restocking mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive CCTV system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to NPCs</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It wasn't me.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448270/aa5179b74e3ad8a0457b6feb311c617dc74837db.jpg"},{"name":"Goal!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448270/2e82b7b1737afbae1c6b069f41d0025badbc8c5b.jpg"},{"name":"Keep it tidy.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448270/228e7dd094a1e505a09e6302b3b77c4908f5efd9.jpg"},{"name":"Toss it.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448270/422b05b770d1c9237ba12f7a97f557c65cb04805.jpg"},{"name":"Shelves Resupplied.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448270/90c0d32483af725190b85bba0b3154ce12a6e32e.jpg"},{"name":"Beep.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448270/61d6bcbc6c84f4eb6cb6d2d6ed816b10f1e0909e.jpg"},{"name":"Not Today, Thank You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448270/cb042a2b2f88df0df215e74e004cd194596259dc.jpg"},{"name":"Shift's Over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448270/a9e4d7825292e3a3a8ed02a123c61199b8a395e4.jpg"},{"name":"Reverse Psychology.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448270/6d269493355e451cefe22809295f5c60e246201d.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3448270?t=1744566349","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3448270?t=1744566349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/071770b5f28cdff34060761ade7bad4e825e9740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744566349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448270/07